  <p class=MsoNormal>Haay..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Damishq ka hai safar berida hai aale nabi</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Na mehmile na kajawa hai na hawdaj hai koiii</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Aseer sab the magar ek hi rasan me bandhe</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Gala sakina ka hai shaane haram ke jakde hue</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Rasan jo khichti hai karti hai sakina naale..</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Thehro. Ahista chalo..(3)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ahista chalo ae phuphi amma rassi se gala ghut-ta hai mera, Ahista chalo..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ae amma gala is tarah jakda hai rasan me</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Do gaam bhi chalne ki nahi jaan badan me..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Khulwa do rasan..(2)</p> 
