  <p class=MsoNormal>Ahista chalo ae phuphi amma rassi se gala ghut-ta hai mera, Ahista chalo..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Kis shaan se nikli thi sawari mere ghar se</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ammu mujhe khud laaye the mehmil me bitha ke..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ek ye hai safar..(2)</p> 
