  <p class=MsoNormal>Ahista chalo ae phuphi amma rassi se gala ghut-ta hai mera, Ahista chalo..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>&nbsp;</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Mai aapke zakhmo se bhi waqif hu phuphijaan</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Kuch wade nibhane hai mujhe barsare zindaan..(2)</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Bus kehti hu mai, bus kehti hu </p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Bahaale pareshaan, rassi se gala ghut-ta hai mera</p> 
  <p class=MsoNormal>Ahista chalo ae phuphi amma rassi se gala ghut-ta hai mera, Ahista chalo..(2)</p> 
